                                                "sense_id": "89815f0f-5d1d-3a63-8573-61bafb2326f4",
                                                "text": "Altman, the techno-optimist bent on commercialization, lost out to Sutskever, the Brutus cum mad scientist fearful that super-smart AI poses an existential risk to humanity."
